  "details": "I dont know why, but ever since this open beta got released, everything it touches lags like hell, i cant go into my socials tab without dropping 20 frames (not an exaggeration) please fix it, im noticing with more people I ask that its more friends you have = more lag. Cause when im in a favorite friends tab with like 3 people im not lagging, but then i enter the dreaded 'all friends' tab and I start lagging like crazy. Its not just friends tabs either, if you click on someones profile, you lag,  if you go to your own profile, you lag, if you go to marketplace, you lag.",
